1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,000
This little rabbit started as an image.

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:05,500
I wanted to bring it to life.

3
00:00:05,500 --> 00:00:08,000
The first version felt a little off.

4
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:11,500
So I kept tweaking the face and proportions.

5
00:00:11,500 --> 00:00:15,000
Then gave the eyes and nose some depth.

6
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:19,000
And a little bounce to the ears and bag.

7
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:23,000
Now I’m building a peaceful world for it to explore.
